  "notes": "TinyS3 uFL view (u.FL connector shown). Skipped USB-C, u.FL antenna connector, battery connector, buttons. Floating callouts (RGB LED DATA IO18, RGB LED PWR IO17, DETECT 5V PRESENT IO33 VBUS, BATTERY VOLTAGE IO10 VBAT) are internal signals, not pins. TCH names are printed with a space for some pins (TCH 7, TCH 6, TCH 1-5) and without for others (TCH9, TCH8); kept as printed. GND pins carry a white square mark instead of text."
